Adaptation: native Haxe/CadKit construction with the same analytic housing arcs,
0.1 mm inset stack, 11 mm end caps, 4.8 mm flange, 5.1 mm mounting holes,
38.1 mm pilot and 6.35 mm D shaft. Body and shaft fused and refined with topology history for MachineKit use.
No connector/wiring geometry or electrical ratings are inferred.
